# Literature corpus — re-downloadable OA PDFs + regenerable RAG index (keep metadata jsons + artifact)
literature/papers/
literature/sci_index/
# Digitized full-text of third-party arXiv papers (kept local: licensing + repo bloat; re-extractable from PDFs)
literature/refs_digitized/
# Raw external catalog data (re-downloadable from CDS/VizieR via the script that fetches it; ~3.4MB, not ours to redistribute)
experiments/20260911-thermal-pair-fingerprint/data_cache/
# Decompressed Magneticum cluster catalog (the .gz is tracked; this is a
# trivial `gunzip -k` byproduct, regenerate with that command)
experiments/20260909-tng-mass-assortativity/data_cache/*.txt
# Recovered/recolored third-party reference figures (regenerable from the
# source PDF + digitize_figure3_v12.py; same local-only convention as above)
experiments/20260810-zenodo-archive/refs/

# Auto-generated commit history log (post_commit_memory hook) — pure
# redirect of `git log`, not source content
.claude/memory/history/

